       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ZERO-BULK.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ZERO-BULK-PROOFS.
           05  WS-ARITH-EQUIV-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CONSTANT-FOOTPRINT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-GRAPH-OVERHEAD-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-INPLACE-HADAMARD-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-BULK-SEAL-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-ZERO-BULK-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-ZERO-BULK-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-ZERO-BULK-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-ARITH-AND-FOOTPRINT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-OVERHEAD-AND-HADAMARD.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-ZERO-BULK-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-ARITH-AND-FOOTPRINT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ARITH-EQUIV-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CONSTANT-FOOTPRINT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-OVERHEAD-AND-HADAMARD.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-GRAPH-OVERHEAD-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-INPLACE-HADAMARD-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-ZERO-BULK-PROOFS.
           IF WS-ARITH-EQUIV-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CONSTANT-FOOTPRINT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ZERO-GRAPH-OVERHEAD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-INPLACE-HADAMARD-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-BULK-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-ZERO-BULK-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-ZERO-BULK-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-ZERO-BULK-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-ZERO-BULK-CODE.
